/* Icon resource for retro_agent.exe.
 *
 * Without this the exe has no resource directory at all, so every desktop
 * shortcut the agent makes for ITSELF ("Retro Agent", placed by
 * gs_place_tool_shortcuts) shows Windows' generic application icon - two of
 * the generic icons on a fully provisioned desktop were ours, not a game's.
 *
 * ID 1 (the lowest numeric id) is what Explorer picks for a file's icon, so
 * this must stay id 1.
 */
1 ICON "retro_agent.ico"
